# Maestro

- Policy SoT: `decide()` in `policy.ts`. Deny is final (no confirm).
- `stageLive` → deny all. Never `writeSlot` / direct `writeSystem` / factory reset.
- `stageSystemPlan` → ask (queues into system staging). Denied in patch/library sessions.
- `changePlan` → working-copy fields only; denied in system/library sessions.
- Model never sees SysEx addresses; registry keys / human labels only (`fieldRegistry.ts`).
- Macros: `macros/registry.ts` — set `implemented: true` only when writes are real.
- Keys: sessionStorage by default; optional localStorage; `npm run check:secrets`.
- Architecture notes: `docs/current/maestro-architecture.md`. UX: `docs/current/studio-sessions.md`.
